      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c01",
      "text": "Gravitational-wave inference usually assumes detector noise is Gaussian and stationary, but real LIGO, Virgo, and KAGRA data break that with glitches and drifting spectral lines.",
