      "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_learns_true_noise_distribution_diffu",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
      "text": "It learns the true noise distribution with a diffusion model and couples it to a differentiable waveform for unbiased parameter estimation.",
      "box": [
