      "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_extracting_astrophysics_gravitationa",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
      "text": "Extracting astrophysics from gravitational waves needs Bayesian inference, and that needs a likelihood.",
