      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_gravitational_wave_astronomy_scaling",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
      "text": "Gravitational-wave astronomy is scaling fast, and analyzing large catalogs makes the pipeline sensitive to tiny departures from Gaussian noise that quietly accumulate into bias.",
